<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#processType-possession-ceremony> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Ceremony in which spirits may manifest through initiated practitioners. Includes tambor, bembe, wemilere (Lucumi), Vodou fet, Candomble xire. Drumming, singing, and dance are central."@en .
<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#authority-initiated> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Initiated Practitioner"@en .
<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#initiationLevel-head-initiation> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Full head initiation permanently establishing the initiant as a priest or priestess. Specific name varies by tradition."@en .
<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#timing-lunar-phase> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept> .
