<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#timingRequirement> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Whether this process has specific timing requirements. Values from TimingRequirementScheme. Access: public-unrestricted."@en .
<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#processType-divination> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Ritual consultation for guidance. Includes Ifa consultation, dilogun reading, chamalongos in Palo, and card reading in Espiritismo context. Public category; specific methods and interpretations are access-restricted."@en .
<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#authority-any-practitioner> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Can be performed by any person regardless of initiation status. Example: basic ancestor veneration at boveda, spiritual baths using common herbs."@en .
<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#timing-calendar-feast> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept> .
