<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#processName> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The name of this ritual process in its tradition. Example: Rogacion de Cabeza, Kariocha, Kanzo, Tambor de Fundamento. Access: public-unrestricted."@en .
<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#AuthorityLevelScheme> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Authority Level Classification"@en .
<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#processType-elevation> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Ceremony to elevate the spirit of a deceased person or clear unresolved spiritual burdens. Common in Espiritismo and Lucumi death rites."@en .
<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#processName> <https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#minimumAccessLevel> <https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#access-public-unrestricted> .
