<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#purposeDescription> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "General description of the purpose and outcome of this ritual process. Non-operational. Access: public-unrestricted."@en .
<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#timing-emergency> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#TimingRequirementScheme> .
