<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#processType-initiation-reception> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Reception of sacred objects conferring a level of initiation without full head initiation. Examples: receiving Warriors, receiving Olokun, receiving necklaces. Creates formal relationship with specific entities."@en .
<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#processType-feast-celebration> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Celebration ceremonies: anniversary of initiation, feast days of entities, communal celebrations."@en .
