<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#secretComponents> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#RitualProcess> .
<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#initiationLevel-tradition-specific> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Initiation levels that do not map to general categories. Document with tradition context via iroko:tradition and iroko:operationalNotes."@en .
<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#processType-funerary> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept> .
