<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#processType-sacrifice-offering> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Ceremonies involving animal sacrifice or major offerings to spiritual entities. General category is public; specific animals, quantities, and procedures are initiated-only or initiated-elder."@en .
<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#processType-head-feeding> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Ritual feeding and cooling of the head (Ori) with white foods and prayers. Strengthens personal destiny and calms spiritual disturbances. One of the most fundamental ceremonies across Yoruba-derived traditions."@en .
<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#role-godparent> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Padrino"@en .
<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#materialRequirements> <https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#minimumAccessLevel> <https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#access-initiated-only> .
<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#conferredTitle> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#InitiatoryRite> .
<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#role-godparent> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Marraine"@en .
<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#sequenceStep> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#InitiationLevelScheme> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Levels of initiation conferred by initiatory rites. General structure is cross-traditional; specific levels are tradition-dependent."@en .
<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#role-helper> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept> .
