<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#conferredTitle> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Title or designation conferred upon completion of this initiatory rite. Example: Olorisha, Babalawo, Mambo, Houngan, Tata Nkisi. Access: public-unrestricted."@en .
<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#sponsorRequirement> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#InitiatoryRite> .
