<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#processType-initiation-full> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Full head initiation permanently transforming the initiant's spiritual status. Examples: kariocha (Lucumi), kanzo (Vodou), rayamiento (Palo), feitura (Candomble). The most restricted process type."@en .
<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#processType-initiation-reception> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#ProcessTypeScheme> .
