<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#Ceremony> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A recurring ritual event that can be performed multiple times for one or many participants. Examples: bembe, tambor, wemilere, misa espiritual, rogacion de cabeza, ebbo, despojos, velacion. Ceremonies are ongoing practice rather than threshold events."@en .
<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#timingRequirement> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko-travay> .
