<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#role-medium> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Practitioner who may receive spiritual possession during the ceremony. In Espiritismo context, medium for spirit communication."@en .
<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#role-community-member> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "General attendee, potentially uninitiated, present for community portions of the ceremony."@en .
<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#sequenceStepDescription> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "General description of what occurs at this step, without operational specifics. Access: initiated-only."@en .
<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#authority-tradition-specific> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Tradition-Specific Authority"@en .
